| description = The orcs of the Faydark, allied under [[Emperor Crush]], have their stronghold of [[Crushbone]] constantly in a state of war with the armies of [[Felwithe]] and [[Kelethin]] and [[Kaladim]]. The Crushbone Orcs are allied with the [[Indigo Brotherhood]] of [[Neriak]], the Guild of Warriors from the Drow city.  The Ambassador of the Dark Elves can often be found in consultation with Emperor Crush himself. Perhaps it is their habit of enslaving their enemies which upsets the [[Emerald Warriors]] and [[Faydarks Champions]] so, but the warrior guilds of Kelethin and Felwithe have aligned with [[Storm Guard]] from Kaladim in a valiant effort to wipe the orcs from their pristine forests.

